==Restrictions==
Cat Deploy Cost: Only 300¢ or more

==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 2 seconds<sup>60f</sup>, delay 8~24 seconds<sup>240f~720f</sup>.
*3 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 16~20 seconds<sup>480f~600f</sup>.
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[King's Mimic]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
**3 [[Dagshund]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.
**5 [[Gory|Gories]] spawn, delay 13.33~18.67 seconds<sup>400f~560f</sup>.
**6 [[Celeboodle]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 10~13.33 seconds<sup>300f~400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[Axe Cat (Normal Cat)|Dark]], [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|King Dragon]], [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Macho Leg]] and [[Titan Cat (Normal Cat)|Jamiera]] Cats to win. Bring any useful [[Cat Combo]]s you have to help get a faster time.

